sequenceDiagram
    participant O as Task owner
    participant H as Host / coordinator
    participant A as Analyst Worker
    participant Q as Review Worker
    O->>H: Assign team work, inputs and authority
    H->>H: Check contracts, dependencies and bindings
    H->>A: Distribute authorized input and establish assignment
    A-->>H: Fixed report and evidence versions
    H->>Q: Hand off report and required evidence
    Q-->>H: Accept or reject receipt
    Note over H,Q: Continue only after accepted receipt
    Q-->>H: Fixed review
    H->>H: Assemble fixed sources and check completeness
    H-->>O: Deliver artifact package and contributor record
    O->>O: Accept this version and decide adoption separately
